es, citizens, wizards and not only them. Each client has their own order and story, which you can influence when creating a weapon or armory. The kingdom in which we will live and work is on the brink of civil war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BadBarian"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152830/header.jpg?t=1732005323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2152830/523318/188e1fe4b6d4b6cde4f28484e7c9863f1aba97cb/1751082722/dash_av1.mpd?t=1671701109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2152830/523318/188e1fe4b6d4b6cde4f28484e7c9863f1aba97cb/1751082722/dash_h264.mpd?t=1671701109","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2152830/523318/188e1fe4b6d4b6cde4f28484e7c9863f1aba97cb/1751082722/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1671701109","id":256921841,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256921841/movie480.mp4?t=1671701109","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256921841/movie_max.mp4?t=1671701109"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256921841/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1671701109","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256921841/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1671701109","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256921841/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1671701109"}}],"name":"BadSmith","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li>